---
import { PRACTITIONER_URL } from './config';
---

<section class="tw-prac tw-section">
  <div class="tw-prac-inner">
    <div class="tw-prac-text" data-reveal>
      <p class="tw-prac-eyebrow">Take it further</p>
      <h2 class="tw-prac-h">Want to go deeper, or hold this work for <em>others?</em></h2>
      <p class="tw-prac-p">
        After the twelve weeks, you can continue into the live, deepening Practitioner
        Training — whether you’d like to be certified or simply want to master the
        practice for yourself.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>
      <a href={PRACTITIONER_URL} class="tw-btn tw-btn--light tw-btn--lg">
        About the Practitioner path <i class="ph-light ph-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
